---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Platform Philosophy & Architecture — CueCraft"
  description="Explore the classical rigid-body physics model, decoupled renderer architecture, and table specifications powering CueCraft."
  darkScene={true}
>
  <div class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div
      class="absolute -top-32 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[900px] h-[420px] rounded-full pointer-events-none opacity-65"
      style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.14) 0%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.06) 45%, transparent 72%);"
      aria-hidden="true"
    />

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 relative z-10">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/[0.05] border border-white/[0.12] text-emerald-bright text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-bold mb-5">
          Engineering Architecture
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-[1.06] mb-5">
          Deterministic Mechanics <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-bright to-sky-400">Beneath Every Table</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          CueCraft replaces arcade approximation with fixed-timestep rigid-body ballistics across 2D Canvas and lazy-loaded Three.js WebGL.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
        <section class="bg-[#080C12]/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/[0.10] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            1. Beyond Simple Mirror Reflections
          </h2>
          <p>
            Cushions compress under impact, exert tangential rubber friction, and respond dynamically to running or check side spin. Simultaneously, struck balls transition through sliding friction before settling into pure roll.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-[#080C12]/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/[0.10] rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8">
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            2. Headless Core + Dual Synced Renderers
          </h2>
          <p>
            All kinematics run inside a pure TypeScript engine at 60Hz × 4 sub-steps (240Hz effective resolution), guaranteeing zero tunneling and identical predictions in both 2D ballistics and 3D camera views.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
            3. Multi-Table Physical Constants
          </h2>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
            <div class="p-5 rounded-3xl bg-[#080C12]/80 border border-white/[0.10]">
              <span class="text-emerald-bright font-bold block mb-1">12ft SNOOKER</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">3569 mm &times; 1778 mm</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 block mt-1">52.5 mm balls · D-zone baulk</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-3xl bg-[#080C12]/80 border border-white/[0.10]">
              <span class="text-sky-400 font-bold block mb-1">9ft 9-BALL &amp; 8ft 8-BALL</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">2540×1270 / 2240×1120 mm</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 block mt-1">57.15 mm balls · Diamond sights</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-3xl bg-[#080C12]/80 border border-white/[0.10]">
              <span class="text-emerald-bright font-bold block mb-1">CLOTH FRICTION RANGE</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">&mu;<sub>s</sub> = 0.16–0.28 · &mu;<sub>r</sub> = 0.019–0.056</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 block mt-1">Simonis Worsted to Heavy Nap</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5 rounded-3xl bg-[#080C12]/80 border border-white/[0.10]">
              <span class="text-sky-400 font-bold block mb-1">CUSHION ELASTICITY</span>
              <span class="text-white font-bold text-sm">e<sub>c</sub> = 0.56 – 0.93</span>
              <span class="text-slate-400 block mt-1">Radial pocket knuckle normals</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-14 pt-8 border-t border-white/[0.1] flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <span class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white block">
            Step Up to the Table
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">
            Try 2D full-route trace or 3D camera views right in your browser.
          </span>
        </div>
        <a
          href="/play"
          class="px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-bright hover:bg-emerald text-[#05080C] hover:text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all"
        >
          Launch Simulator &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
